 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>Dog Ear Muffs Noise Protection: Built with sound-absorbing pads in the straps and 3 layers of noise protection for effectively calming dogs. dog ear covers block stressful noises like thunderstorms, fireworks, vacuum cleaners, car rides, and construction sounds. Most pups relax within minutes and fall asleep peacefully. Ideal for 4th of July, New Year's Eve, and summer storms.</li>\n  <li>Breathable and Soft Dog Ear Cover: snoods for dogs are breathable and comfortable, providing comfort in summer and warmth in winter. The adjustable drawstring makes it stay securely in place and prevents slipping. This no-shake ear wrap fits all ear types—upright, drop, rose, tulip, hound, flying, button, and semi-upright.</li>\n  <li>Dog Ear Wrap Hematoma: Controls bleeding and secures ear medications after hematoma surgery. Allows easy use of a dog door, access to water and food bowls, and ensures comfortable sleep. Pets can also resume regular activities like running and playing, without hindrance<br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/f9196044-3aee-46ac-9066-dd4ffe0004e9.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/9510f2d1-1aec-42a2-8905-cc66e03bc3c9.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/b7af4491-277a-4525-80ec-7d5d02dca333.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
